BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 628 Tm (Edge, 0x14 AST, 0x24 NEC, 0x56 AT&T, 0xE5 Tandy, 0xF2 Sperry/Unisys. Interpret logical geometry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 612 Tm (explicitly, never assume that the BPB sector size equals a physical device sector. DOS 3.2's historical) Tj ET
