BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 548 Tm (4,294,180,864 bytes. The complete volume includes metadata. 64 KiB and larger clusters have limited OS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 532 Tm (compatibility; early DOS and later Windows support differs. The 32-bit file-length field is bounded at 4) Tj ET
