BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 644 Tm (successor=0x0002..0xFFEF; reserved=0xFFF0..0xFFF6; bad=0xFFF7; EOC=0xFFF8..0xFFFF. FAT[0]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 628 Tm (normally 0xFF00 | media; FAT[1] normally 0xFFFF. In supported status conventions FAT[1] bit 15 is clean) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 612 Tm (shutdown, bit 14 is no recorded I/O error \(clear indicates adverse state\); these flags are not general) Tj ET
